[311.850368, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[6;29r\u001b[6;1H\u001b[11T\u001b[1;42r\u001b[6;28H\u001b[38;5;243m│\u001b[m    \u001b[38;5;243m⠿ thought for 0s · 104 tok · ctrl+e\u001b[m\r\n + New team in project     \u001b[38;5;243m│\u001b[m\r\n ✦ Organize\u001b[16X\u001b[8;28H\u001b[38;5;243m│\u001b[m  \u001b[38;5;252mHanded the change to \u001b[38;5;146;4m@builder\u001b[38;5;252;24m. It will add the optional \u001b[48;5;234m--shopping\u001b[49m flag (prints \u001b[48;5;234mitem:\u001b[m\u001b[9;28H\u001b[38;5;243m│\u001b[m  \u001b[38;5;252;48;5;234mbuy N\u001b[49m, where N = threshold − stock, for strictly-below items only; default output\u001b[m\u001b[10;28H\u001b[38;5;243m│\u001b[m  \u001b[38;5;252muntouched), reject negative stock counts as a line-numbered malformed-input error (exit\u001b[m\u001b[11;28H\u001b[38;5;243m│\u001b[m  \u001b[38;5;252m2, no partial output), extend the tests, and rewrite \u001b[4m\u001b]8;;file:///tmp/caf-extended-1597/project/README.md\u0007README.md\u001b[24m\u001b]8;;\u0007 with real observed usage\u001b[m\u001b[12;28H\u001b[38;5;243m│\u001b[m  \u001b[38;5;252mexamples. It runs the CLI and tests and reports raw output.\u001b[m\u001b[13;28H\u001b[38;5;243m│\u001b[m\n\b\u001b[38;5;243m│\u001b[m  \u001b[38;5;252mOne judgment call I fixed in the brief: negative stock is rejected in both modes, not\u001b[m\u001b[15;28H\u001b[38;5;243m│\u001b[m  \u001b[38;5;252monly under \u001b[48;5;234m--shopping\u001b[49m — so a negative count can never inflate a suggested purchase\u001b[m\u001b[16;28H\u001b[38;5;243m│\u001b[m  \u001b[38;5;252manywhere. Say the word if you wanted it rejected only under \u001b[48;5;234m--shopping\u001b[49m.\u001b[m\u001b[18;27H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\n\u001b[140G\u001b[38;5;252m❮\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[139G\u001b[38;5;243m11\u001b[m\r\u001b[28;33H\u001b[38;5;243m▸ \u001b[m\n\b\b\u001b[38;5;243m▸ Work · ctrl+e\u001b[m\u001b[67X\u001b[29;115H\u001b[38;5;238m+4.9k\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;238m↑\u001b[38;5;252m 42.1k\u001b[m  \u001b[38;5;238m↓